    summary_60s: 'This section includes the following texts for study: Al-A\'ala (Qur\'an 87). Ad-Duha (Qur\'an 93). Al-Inshirah (Qur\'an 94). At-Tin (Qur\'an 95). Al-Alaq (Qur\'an 96). Al-Qadr (Qur\'an 97). Al-Bayyinah (Qur\'an 98). Al-Zilzal (Qur\'an 99). Ayat al-Kursi (Qur\'an 2:255). Aman ar-Rasul (Qur\'',
