    subtopic: 'Kalimats-Sahaadah',
    summary_60s: 'Shahadah (Kalima) – The First Pillar of Islam The Shahadah , also known as the Kalima or Kalimatu-tawhid , is the first pillar of Islam. It is the first and most essential requirement for becoming a Muslim: to believe in it sincerely and act according to that belief. The Kalima i',
