    summary_60s: 'The Six Articles of Faith in Islam Islam is built upon five pillars, one of which is Iman —belief in Allah, His messengers, His books, His angels, destiny, and the Last Day. These are collectively known by the scholars ( ulamaa ) as the articles of faith , and they form the found',
