    summary_60s: 'Also spelled Haj , Hajj is the annual pilgrimage to Makkah, Saudi Arabia , that all able Muslims are expected to perform at least once in their lifetime. It is the fifth pillar of Islam and takes place over five days, with around two million Muslims participating each year. Hajj ',
