    summary_60s: 'Allah: The Supreme Being Allah is the Supreme Being, the One to whom the power of decree in the heavens and the earth belongs. He commands and controls all that exists in both the heavens and the earth. Allah is the sole controller and decree of everything. His Law is in force in',
